   {
    "x": 40,
    "y": 880,
    "rotation": 0,
    "id": 115,
    "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.rectangle",
    "width": 1300,
    "height": 300,
    "lockAspectRatio": false,
    "lockShape": false,
    "order": 70,
    "hidden": false,
    "layerId": "L0",
    "linkMap": [],
    "graphic": {
     "type": "Shape",
     "Shape": {
      "tid": "com.gliffy.stencil.rectangle.basic_v1",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#D3D1C7",
      "fillColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "gradient": false,
      "dropShadow": false,
      "state": 0,
      "shadowX": 0,
      "shadowY": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "dashStyle": null
     }
    },
    "children": [
     {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "rotation": 0,
      "id": 116,
      "uid": null,
      "width": 1296,
      "height": 300,
      "lockAspectRatio": false,
      "lockShape": false,
      "order": "auto",
      "hidden": false,
      "layerId": "L0",
      "children": null,
      "graphic": {
       "type": "Text",
       "Text": {
        "tid": null,
        "valign": "top",
        "overflow": "none",
        "vposition": "none",
        "hposition": "none",
        "html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;color:#2C2C2A;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">CIAM sign-in flow (SIT2): all CIAM calls go to qa2.auth.bmo.com</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#185FA5;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Start sign-in</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">1   CDB SPA → Identity Server   GET /isvaop/oauth2/authorize   ↳ 401 (expected: user not signed in yet)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">2   CDB SPA → loads Authenticator MFE   GET /login/cdb/ciam_mfe.js</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#185FA5;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">User signs in</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">3   Authenticator MFE → Identity Server   /aac/sps/apiauthsvc/policy/idp_authenticator   ↳ checks username and password</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">4   Authenticator MFE → Identity Server   /aac/sps/apiauthsvc/policy/idp_macotp   ↳ checks OTP (only if required)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#185FA5;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Get tokens</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">5   CDB SPA → Identity Server   GET /isvaop/oauth2/authorize + DPoP proof   ↳ 200, returns auth code and state</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">6   Browser → CDB callback   green.www.olb-qa5.dev.bmo.com/banking/digital/ciam-callback</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">7   CDB SPA → Identity Server   POST /isvaop/oauth2/token (auth code + PKCE verifier + DPoP)   ↳ access, refresh and ID tokens</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#185FA5;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Start CDB session</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">8   CDB SPA → Akamai → CWH APIC → CDBBOS   /api/cdb-ui/contact-handler/session/initCDBSession   ↳ creates the CDB banking session</span></p>",
        "paddingLeft": 6,
        "paddingRight": 6,
        "paddingBottom": 6,
        "paddingTop": 6
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   },
